WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.300
The resistor limits how much current flows.

2
00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:07.751
Two hundred and twenty ohms gives about six milliamps.

3
00:00:09.727 --> 00:00:13.202
With no resistor, far too much current flows.

4
00:00:14.878 --> 00:00:17.678
A bigger resistor means less current.
